# Music assets

Place the game's music exports in this directory using these names:

- `title.mp3` — title and character creation
- `exploration.mp3` — dungeon exploration
- `combat.mp3` — all combat encounters

Tracks loop automatically. Music volume and mute controls are available from
the exploration menu. Missing files are allowed; the game runs silently and
reports that no music is installed.

Use music you own or have permission to distribute. Keep original project files
outside the runtime asset folder and export loop-ready MP3 files here.
